s:</strong> Original electronic music and ambient sound effects perfectly render the complex, interwoven emotions of suspense, tension, and isolation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digital Voyeurism:</strong> The narrative unfolds entirely through surveillance feeds, computer screens, and a first-person perspective, delivering a highly immersive &quot;digital voyeur&quot; experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features a wide variety of complex characters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143220/extras/b6bcdb4e8fbac8d0c466995bc0939bdc.poster.avif?t=1788147402\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143220/extras/b6bcdb4e8fbac8d0c466995bc0939bdc.webm?t=1788147402\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143220/extras/b6bcdb4e8fbac8d0c466995bc0939bdc.mp4?t=1788147402\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will take on the role of an undercover journalist masquerading as a night-shift security guard, interacting with various tenants, property management staff, and your direct superior.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character harbors their own secrets, motives, and lies. Beyond the reach of the surveillance cameras, who are they really? Are they victims, accomplices, or the killer themselves?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The developers describe the content like this:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The game contains descriptions of crime scenes, mild blood and gore, and psychological horror elements, but features no jump scares or chase sequences. All content serves the narrative and atmosphere, aiming to create a heart-pounding deduction experience.</p>", "short_description": "A bizarre murder breaks the peace of Jin Xiao Apartment. As the new night guard, your only tools are the surveillance cameras and the residents' passing words. Everyone here has a secret. The truth is hidden between your screens and your deduction notes.", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143220/46c517848ff7a7adca3a0076d2b65b9e0ee7fa37/header.jpg?t=1788147402", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143220/10bdfcfdeab0091818cf45d64a89498a22605c16/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788147402", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4143220/10bdfcfdeab0091818cf45d64a89498a22605c16/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788147402", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 独立显卡<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong>  Intel Core i5或AMD equivalent 或以上<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 独立显卡<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Buddy Studio"], "publishers": ["Buddy Studio"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 999, "final": 999, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$9.99"}, "packages": [1451604], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "t